# Hunt HSTR2-01: each mode at 1000 and 4000 (RtGlueAlloc.lean). Natively
# `toList` makes one cons cell per character, `get?` allocates nothing and
# `frExp` makes its pair (and the boxed mantissa); lean2rr's glue made about
# 3 allocations per character, 1 per `get?` and a closure per `frExp`.
list 1000 | list 4000 | 1 200
getq 1000 | getq 4000 | 1 200
frexp 1000 | frexp 4000 | 1 200
